flowchart TB
    S[Immutable source snapshot] --> G[Revision-bound dependency graph]
    S -->|exact bounded source files| A[Architect model]
    K[Curated versioned Agentic LLM Wiki] --> T[Persisted Architect RetrievalTrace and digest]
    T --> A
    G --> A
    A --> P[ArchitectManifestProposal]
    P --> C[Controller policy and canonical manifest]
    C --> I{Exact human manifest interrupt}
    I -->|reject or modify| X[Safe stop; no candidate]
    I -->|approve digest| E[Engineer attempt one returns full eleven-file plan]
    T -->|exact planning handoff| E
    E --> W[Controller applies exact paths in isolated workspace]
    W --> D[Disk-derived ChangeSet]
    D --> V[Controller-owned allowlisted validation]
    V --> R[Terminal receipts and ValidationReport]
    R --> Q[Validator evidence-only advisory]
    Q --> B{Controller evidence classification}
    B -->|ready for human review| H[Independent final-review stop]
    B -->|recoverable attempt one| CT[Separate targeted correction RetrievalTrace and digest]
    CT --> C2{Separate exact correction approval}
    C2 -->|approved attempt two| E2[Engineer returns changed-file delta only]
    T -.->|baseline trace retained| E2
    CT --> E2
    E2 --> W2[Overlay delta on immutable prior plan]
    W2 --> D
    C2 -->|not approved| X2[Safe stop; retry not executed]
    B -->|plan invalid| N[Stop; new Architect request and manifest required]
    B -->|environment unavailable or retry exhausted| U[Stop with unavailable or failed evidence]
    H --> Z[No Git, deploy, publication, or pilot authority]
